// The spacefast deliver sink publishes a command's output as a live web page
// on Spacefast (https://spacefast.com) and prints the URL.
//
//	--deliver spacefast:<name>          page named <name>
//	--deliver spacefast:<name>,public   same, publicly viewable (new pages only)
//
// With SPACEFAST_TOKEN set (an API key or OAuth token), the page is created
// in that account's team (SPACEFAST_TEAM picks one when there are several).
// Without a token the page is published anonymously: the receipt carries a
// private link and a claim link, and the page's key is kept in this CLI's
// state directory so a later --deliver to the same <name> updates the same
// page instead of creating another.

